{"articleNo":"85600","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=85600&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2012학년도 후기(2013년 8월) 졸업예정자 성적취소 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.06.21","hit":"6352","attachments":[{"name":"성적 취소 신청원.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=85600&attachNo=2790"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 18pt; COLOR: #000080; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2012학년도 후기(2013년 8월)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 18pt; COLOR: #800000; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">졸업예정자 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 18pt; COLOR: #800000; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">성적취소 안내</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">* 졸업예정자가 아닌 경우에는 2013학년도 2학기에 성적을 취소하기 바랍니다.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;성적취소 및 이수구분 변경 신청기간 : 2013.09.30.(월)～10.04.(금) [재학생만 가능]</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">1. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">성적취소 대상 : 2012학년도 후기 졸업예정자에 한함</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 8pt; COLOR: #800000; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">2. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">성적취소 범위 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">아래 각 호의 어느 하나에 해당하는 성적은 취소 가능</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 46.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -46.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #000080; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;1) </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #000080; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">7학기이상 등록자에 한하여 6학점 이내의 성적</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 46.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -46.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #800000; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;→ 기 사용자는 성적취소 할 수 없음</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 102.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -102.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #000080; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 졸업예정자로서 그 성적이 “F”인 과목</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 8pt; COLOR: #800000; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">3. 신청기간 : 2013.07.16.(화)～07.18.(목)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 8pt; COLOR: #800000; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">4. 신청장소 : 해당 종합학사행정실 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 8pt; COLOR: #800000; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">5. 신청방법 : 성적취소 신청원 작성→해당 종합학사행정실 제출</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 46.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -46.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #000080; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;1) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">성적증명서 제출 생략</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 32.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -32.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #000080; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;2) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #000080; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">정확한 성적취소 처리를 위해 신청원 작성시 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #000080; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">교과목코드, 교과목명을 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 32.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -32.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #000080; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"><font color=\"#666666\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </font></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #000080; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">정확히 기재하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 8pt; COLOR: #800000; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">6. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">성적취소내역 확인</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 일시 : 2013.07.24.(수) [예정]</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 확인방법 : 원스톱서비스-학적부-학적자료조회-성적정정/포기&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 102.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -102.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #000080; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 102.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -102.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">2013. 06. </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 102.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -102.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 102.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -102.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" 